# The configuration of the targets whose sources are all test code, over
# the configuration of each source's own directory in the checkout: the
# build composes the two at configure, as clang-tidy dumps them, into a
# file of the build tree it names for those sources' steps, and a header
# takes the source it is compiled through. A check off here is an entry of
# analysis-exemptions.json with the scope "test code".
InheritParentConfig: true
